    {
      "user_id": 1,
      "message": "What is PM-KISAN?",
      "response": "Popular central schemes: PM-KISAN (Rs 6,000/year income support), PMFBY (crop insurance), Kisan Credit Card (cheap crop loans), PMKSY (irrigation support), Soil Health Card (free soil testing). See the Schemes page in SmartCrop for full details and the official websites to apply. State schemes differ by state â€” ask your district agriculture office.",
